t was exactly as described and arrived in excellent condition. Shipping was fast, packaging was secure, and the value was spot on. The quality and appearance were great and matched the listing perfectly. Communication with the seller was excellent from start to finish. I’m very happy with the purchase and would gladly buy from this seller again. Highly recommended! Everything about the transaction felt smooth, honest, and professional, which made the experience even better overall. A++"},"imageCount":"0","verifiedPurchaseSignal":{"_type":"TextualDisplay","textSpans":[{"_type":"TextSpan","text":"Подтвержденная покупка"}]}}},{"_type":"FeedbackCard","feedbackId":"2906844030015","feedbackInfo":{"rating":{"_type":"Icon","name":"POSITIVE","accessibilityText":"Положительный показатель отзывов"},"context":{"_type":"TextualDisplay","textSpans":[{"_type":"TextSpan","text":"i***6 (14)"}],"accessibilityText":"Отзыв, оставленный покупателем."},"contextTime":{"_type":"TextualDisplay","textSpans":[{"_type":"TextSpan","text":"За последние 6 месяцев"}],"accessibilityText":"За последние 6 месяцев"},"item":{"itemSummary":{"_type":"TextualDisplay","textSpans":[{"_type":"TextSpan","text":"Apollo 11 Documentary History Hot Movie Wall Art Home Decor - POSTER 20\"x30\" (№386860530841)"}]}},"comment":{"_type":"TextualDisplay","textSpans":[{"_type":"TextSpan","text":"Because of a problem caused by the USPS, I never got this item. It was stuck in a facility part way through the process. When I reported that, the seller very quickly refunded my purchase price. I hope they get the poster back! If the post office finds it and delivers it, I'll contact the seller to try and return it to them. I'm giving them five stars throughout for their responsiveness!"}],"accessibilityText":"Because of a problem caused by the USPS, I never got this item. It was stuck in a facility part way through the process. When I reported that, the seller very quickly refunded my purchase price. I hope they get the poster